msgstr "# Run all test cases serially\\n"

msgid "安装常见问题"
msgstr "# Installation FAQ"

msgid "**问题一：安装TorchNPU时出现报错“ERROR: No matching distribution found for torch==2.7.1+cpu”**"
msgstr "**Issue 1: Error \"ERROR: No matching distribution found for torch==2.7.1+cpu\" occurs when installing TorchNPU**"

msgid "**解决措施**"
msgstr "**Resolution**"

msgid "可以尝试手动安装torch后再安装TorchNPU："
msgstr "You can try manually installing torch first, and then install TorchNPU."

msgid "pip install torch==2.7.1+cpu --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu\\n"
msgstr "pip install torch==2.7.1+cpu --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu"

msgid "**问题二：编译安装Triton-Ascend时，如果GCC < 9.4.0，可能报错“ld.lld: error: unable to find library -lstdc++fs”**"
msgstr "**Problem 2: When you compile and install Triton-Ascend, if GCC < 9.4.0, you may encounter the error \"ld.lld: error: unable to find library -lstdc++fs\"**"

msgid "一般是链接器无法找到stdc++fs库引起的报错。该库用于支持GCC 9之前版本的文件系统特性。此时需要手动把CMake文件中以下相关代码片段的注释打开。 文件路径：triton-ascend/CMakeLists.txt"
msgstr "This error is usually caused by the linker being unable to find the stdc++fs library. This library is used to support the filesystem features of GCC versions prior to 9. In this case, you need to manually uncomment the relevant code snippet in the CMake file. File path: triton-ascend/CMakeLists.txt"

msgid "if (NOT WIN32 AND NOT APPLE)\\n"
msgstr "if (NOT WIN32 AND NOT APPLE)"

msgid "**问题三：执行算子时报错“ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package”**"
msgstr "**Issue 3: The error \"ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package\" occurs when running an operator**"

msgid "**根因分析**"
msgstr "**Root Cause Analysis**"

msgid "triton-ascend目录被triton覆盖，导致triton-ascend功能受损。"
msgstr "The triton-ascend directory is overwritten by triton, which compromises the functionality of triton-ascend."

msgid "卸载已损坏的triton-ascend，重新安装即可。以3.2.1版本为例，可执行如下命令修复："
msgstr "Uninstall the corrupted triton-ascend and reinstall it. For example, to fix version 3.2.1, run the following commands:"

msgid "pip uninstall triton-ascend triton\\n"
msgstr "pip uninstall triton-ascend triton"

msgid "**问题四：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本为何新增依赖triton？**"
msgstr "**Question 4: Why does Triton-Ascend 3.2.1 add a dependency on Triton?**"

msgid "答复：Triton-Ascend是基于Triton进行的二次开发，与Triton安装目录同名。若用户安装Triton-Ascend之后，再次安装Triton或依赖Triton的三方件，会覆盖Triton目录，导致Triton-Ascend功能受损。 因此通过增加Triton依赖，当Triton被覆盖安装时会有如下提醒。"
msgstr "Answer: Triton-Ascend is a secondary development based on Triton and shares the same installation directory name as Triton. If users install Triton or third-party components that depend on Triton after installing Triton-Ascend, the Triton directory will be overwritten, compromising Triton-Ascend functionality. Therefore, by adding a Triton dependency, the following reminder will appear when Triton is overwritten during installation."

msgid "ERROR: pip's dependency resolver does not currently take into account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts.\\n"
msgstr "ERROR: pip's dependency resolver does not currently take into account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts."

msgid "若用户遇到且想恢复Triton-Ascend功能，可根据问题三的解决措施进行命令修复。"
msgstr "If you encounter the issue and want to restore Triton-Ascend functionality, run the repair commands based on the solution in Issue 3."

msgid "**问题五：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本依赖的Triton版本为何不一致？**"
msgstr "**Issue 5: Why are the Triton versions inconsistent across Triton-Ascend 3.2.1 dependencies?**"

msgid "答复：x86与Arm使用不同版本的社区Triton安装包，是因为社区从Triton 3.2版本开始提供x86安装包，而Arm安装包是从Triton 3.5版本开始提供的。"
msgstr "Answer: x86 and Arm use different versions of the community Triton installation package because the community began providing the x86 installation package in Triton version 3.2, while the Arm installation package became available in Triton version 3.5."

msgid "**问题六：如何确认芯片类型？**"
msgstr "**Question 6: How do I confirm the chip type?**"

msgid "可以使用npu-smi命令查看系统上的NPU型号。例如，在npu-smi info命令的输出中，“910B4”对应芯片类型A2（昇腾910b系列）："
msgstr "You can use the npu-smi command to view the NPU model on the system. For example, in the output of the npu-smi info command, \"910B4\" corresponds to chip type A2 (Ascend 910b series):"

msgid "root@localhost:/# npu-smi  info\\n"
msgstr "root@localhost:/# npu-smi info"
